a new emerging technique has introduced that anyone can make highly realistic but fake videos, images even can manipulate the voices. This technology is widely known as Deepfake Technology. Although it seems interesting techniques to make fake videos or image of something or some individuals but it could spread as misinformation via internet. Deepfake contents could be dangerous for individuals as well as for our communities, organizations, countries religions etc. As Deepfake content creation involve a high- level expertise with combination of several algorithms of deep learning, it seems almost real and genuine and difficult to differentiate. In this paper, a wide range of articles have been examined to understand Deepfake technology more extensively. We have examined several articles to find some insights such as what is Deepfake, who are responsible for this, is there any benefits of Deepfake and what are the challenges of this technology. We have also examined several creation and detection techniques. Our study revealed that although Deepfake is a threat to our societies, proper measures and strict regulations could prevent this.\nKeywords: Deepfake Detection, Deep Learning, GAN, Face Manipulation, AI Forensics","authors":[{"id":"2000918899","name":"B. Mahmud","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]},{"id":"2330318885","name":"Afsana Sharmin","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]}],"institution_ids":[],"venue":{"id":"venue-0350c2726acbc6","name":"International Journal of Creative and Open Research in Engineering and Management","short_name":"","type":"unknown","issn":"","rankings":[]},"task_tags":["deepfake_detection"],"contribution_type":"survey","review_status":"verified","doi":"10.55041/ijcope.v2i5.446","arxiv_id":"2105.00192","openalex_id":"","semantic_scholar_id":"442477e0e3cae25eb489a6e5cacbfc62a1cc8a02","primary_url":"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/442477e0e3cae25eb489a6e5cacbfc62a1cc8a02","citation_count":50,"provenance":[{"source":"semantic_scholar","source_id":"442477e0e3cae25eb489a6e5cacbfc62a1cc8a02","url":"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/442477e0e3cae25eb489a6e5cacbfc62a1cc8a02","query":"GAN image forensics","retrieved_at":"2026-07-16T04:10:05Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：具有稳定来源，且任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"},{"id":"paper-8e06cfb1a2e00fc0","title":"Steganalysis LSB Matching pada Grayscale Image menggunakan Machine Learning","title_zh":"","year":2021,"publication_date":"","abstract":"","authors":[{"id":"author-d23653c748897e","name":"Syifa Nurgaida Yutia","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]}],"institution_ids":[],"venue":{"id":"venue-1cd462fb441a6a","name":"Journal of Informatics and Communication Technology (JICT)","short_name":"","type":"journal","issn":"2686-1089","rankings":[]},"task_tags":["image_steganalysis"],"contribution_type":"analysis","review_status":"verified","doi":"10.52661/j_ict.v3i1.69","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"","semantic_scholar_id":"","primary_url":"https://doi.org/10.52661/j_ict.v3i1.69","citation_count":0,"provenance":[{"source":"crossref","source_id":"10.52661/j_ict.v3i1.69","url":"https://doi.org/10.52661/j_ict.v3i1.69","query":"deep learning image steganalysis","retrieved_at":"2026-07-16T04:06:01Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：具有稳定来源，且任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"},{"id":"paper-cb7bfed980665ac0","title":"Neural Steganalysis with Spatial Rich Models for Image Steganography Detection","title_zh":"","year":2020,"publication_date":"2020-03-12","abstract":"Digital image steganalysis is the process of detecting if an image contains concealed data embedded within its pixel space inserted via a steganography algorithm. The detection of these images is highly motivated by Advanced Persistent Threat (APT) groups, such as APT37 Reaper, commonly utilizing these techniques to transmit malicious shellcode to perform further post-exploitation activity on a compromised host. Performing detection has become increasingly difficult due to modern steganography algorithms advancing at a greater rate than the steganalysis techniques designed to combat them. The task of detection is challenging due to modern steganography techniques that embed messages into images with only minor modifications to the original content which varies from image to image. In this paper, we pipeline Spatial Rich Models (SRM) feature extraction, Principal Component Analysis (PCA), and Deep Neural Networks (DNNs) to perform image steganalysis. Our proposed model, Neural Spatial Rich Models (NSRM) is an ensemble of DNN classifiers trained to detect 4 different state-of-the-art steganography algorithms at 5 different embedding rates, allowing for an end-to-end model which can be more easily deployed at scale. Additionally our results show our proposed model outperforms other current state-of-the-art neural network based image steganalysis techniques. Lastly, we provide an analysis of the current academic steganalysis benchmark dataset, BOSSBase, as well as performance of detection of steganography in various file formats with the hope of moving image steganalysis algorithms towards the point they can be utilized in actual industry applications.","authors":[{"id":"a5055672869","name":"Jonathan Lwowski","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]},{"id":"a5035385486","name":"Isaac Corley","orcid":"0000-0002-9273-7303","institution_ids":[]},{"id":"a5110459222","name":"Justin D. Hoffman","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]}],"institution_ids":[],"venue":null,"task_tags":["image_steganalysis"],"contribution_type":"analysis","review_status":"verified","doi":"10.36227/techrxiv.11949762","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"W4236356497","semantic_scholar_id":"","primary_url":"https://doi.org/10.36227/techrxiv.11949762","citation_count":3,"provenance":[{"source":"openalex","source_id":"W4236356497","url":"https://openalex.org/W4236356497","query":"image steganalysis detection","retrieved_at":"2026-07-15T06:11:49Z"},{"source":"crossref","source_id":"10.36227/techrxiv.11949762.v1","url":"https://doi.org/10.36227/techrxiv.11949762.v1","query":"image steganalysis detection","retrieved_at":"2026-07-15T06:17:03Z"},{"source":"crossref","source_id":"10.36227/techrxiv.11949762","url":"https://doi.org/10.36227/techrxiv.11949762","query":"image steganalysis detection","retrieved_at":"2026-07-15T06:17:03Z"},{"source":"semantic_scholar","source_id":"fbfedecc6fc424c2316ddec5aa7a89468efbe502","url":"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/fbfedecc6fc424c2316ddec5aa7a89468efbe502","query":"image steganography detection benchmark","retrieved_at":"2026-07-16T04:11:00Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：已有稳定来源，且现有任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"},{"id":"paper-377705793a5da5c0","title":"by Means of Digital Watermarking: A Review. The","title_zh":"","year":2017,"publication_date":"","abstract":"","authors":[{"id":"2143827089","name":"A. Borah","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]},{"id":"2387473033","name":"B. Borah","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]}],"institution_ids":[],"venue":null,"task_tags":["digital_watermarking"],"contribution_type":"survey","review_status":"verified","doi":"","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"","semantic_scholar_id":"1e41956147125659d1cdb57fdc0997803de4fc0c","primary_url":"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/1e41956147125659d1cdb57fdc0997803de4fc0c","citation_count":0,"provenance":[{"source":"semantic_scholar","source_id":"1e41956147125659d1cdb57fdc0997803de4fc0c","url":"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/1e41956147125659d1cdb57fdc0997803de4fc0c","query":"watermark removal attack image","retrieved_at":"2026-07-16T04:11:27Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：具有稳定来源，且任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"},{"id":"paper-59adb3cc1a69dfc0","title":"A new block-based method for copy move forgery detection under image geometric transforms","title_zh":"","year":2016,"publication_date":"2016-12-07","abstract":"","authors":[{"id":"a5102730514","name":"Junliu Zhong","orcid":"0000-0003-0511-9978","institution_ids":["i4210100872"]},{"id":"a5049347899","name":"Yanfen Gan","orcid":"","institution_ids":["i186272606","i4403928342"]},{"id":"a5082321754","name":"Janson Young","orcid":"","institution_ids":["i139024713"]},{"id":"a5086321795","name":"Lian Huang","orcid":"0000-0001-9222-9053","institution_ids":["i4210100872"]},{"id":"a5075986807","name":"Pei-Yu Lin","orcid":"0000-0001-8809-1063","institution_ids":["i4210100872"]}],"institution_ids":["i139024713","i186272606","i4210100872","i4403928342"],"venue":{"id":"venue-e43d0ed7069ca7","name":"Multimedia Tools and Applications","short_name":"MTAP","type":"journal","issn":"","rankings":[]},"task_tags":["image_forgery"],"contribution_type":"method","review_status":"verified","doi":"10.1007/s11042-016-4201-9","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"W2560625046","semantic_scholar_id":"","primary_url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11042-016-4201-9","citation_count":61,"provenance":[{"source":"openalex","source_id":"W2560625046","url":"https://openalex.org/W2560625046","query":"copy move image forgery detection","retrieved_at":"2026-07-15T06:11:49Z"},{"source":"crossref","source_id":"10.1007/s11042-016-4201-9","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11042-016-4201-9","query":"image forgery localization @ ACM Multimedia","retrieved_at":"2026-07-16T07:42:49Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：已有稳定来源，且现有任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"},{"id":"paper-073c3428d4ba55c0","title":"Advanced Techniques for Image Forgery Detection","title_zh":"","year":2016,"publication_date":"","abstract":"","authors":[{"id":"author-3f4d6086c84737","name":"Amruta Prabhakar","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]},{"id":"author-27cf71d4d1413e","name":"H. A.","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]}],"institution_ids":[],"venue":{"id":"venue-db9fff16c4bcb0","name":"International Journal of Computer Applications","short_name":"","type":"journal","issn":"0975-8887","rankings":[]},"task_tags":["image_forgery"],"contribution_type":"method","review_status":"verified","doi":"10.5120/ijca2016910936","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"","semantic_scholar_id":"","primary_url":"https://doi.org/10.5120/ijca2016910936","citation_count":1,"provenance":[{"source":"crossref","source_id":"10.5120/ijca2016910936","url":"https://doi.org/10.5120/ijca2016910936","query":"image forgery detection localization","retrieved_at":"2026-07-16T07:30:38Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：具有稳定来源，且任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"},{"id":"paper-6e8e642fd58297c0","title":"Reflective SIFT for improving the detection of copy-move image forgery","title_zh":"","year":2016,"publication_date":"2016-09-01","abstract":"Due to technology advancement the digital images are losing authenticity. Because of this different detection techniques are put forward. They check for the Genuinity of the images. We need to take care of image forgery. The images can be scaled, rotated, and flipped (mirror reflected). SIFT (Scale invariant feature transform) is mostly used to match images. But it fails for flipped images. A framework, mirror-reflection invariant feature transform (MIFT) is presented. Here, we will learn how MIFT improvise SIFT. The performance evaluation is demonstrated on various databases such as MICC-F2000 and CASIA V2.0.","authors":[{"id":"a5004974180","name":"Vanita Agarwal","orcid":"0000-0001-9053-2577","institution_ids":[]},{"id":"a5078245241","name":"Vanita Mane","orcid":"0000-0002-4303-4089","institution_ids":[]}],"institution_ids":[],"venue":null,"task_tags":["image_forgery"],"contribution_type":"method","review_status":"verified","doi":"10.1109/icrcicn.2016.7813636","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"W2577410471","semantic_scholar_id":"","primary_url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/icrcicn.2016.7813636","citation_count":15,"provenance":[{"source":"openalex","source_id":"W2577410471","url":"https://openalex.org/W2577410471","query":"copy move image forgery detection","retrieved_at":"2026-07-15T06:11:49Z"},{"source":"crossref","source_id":"10.1109/icrcicn.2016.7813636","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/icrcicn.2016.7813636","query":"copy move image forgery detection","retrieved_at":"2026-07-16T04:04:48Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：已有稳定来源，且现有任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"},{"id":"paper-e4c2ff22ce34d1c0","title":"Steganalysis using logistic regression","title_zh":"","year":2011,"publication_date":"2011-02-08","abstract":"We advocate Logistic Regression (LR) as an alternative to the Support Vector Machine (SVM) classifiers commonly used in steganalysis. LR offers more information than traditional SVM methods - it estimates class probabilities as well as providing a simple classification - and can be adapted more easily and efficiently for multiclass problems. Like SVM, LR can be kernelised for nonlinear classification, and it shows comparable classification accuracy to SVM methods. This work is a case study, comparing accuracy and speed of SVM and LR classifiers in detection of LSB Matching and other related spatial-domain image steganography, through the state-of-art 686-dimensional SPAM feature set, in three image sets.","authors":[{"id":"a5017913001","name":"Ivans Lubenko","orcid":"","institution_ids":["i40120149"]},{"id":"a5111728681","name":"Andrew D. Ker","orcid":"0000-0002-1154-3305","institution_ids":["i40120149"]}],"institution_ids":["i40120149"],"venue":{"id":"venue-28757b3c57cb1d","name":"Proceedings of SPIE, the International Society for Optical Engineering/Proceedings of SPIE","short_name":"","type":"journal","issn":"","rankings":[]},"task_tags":["image_steganalysis"],"contribution_type":"analysis","review_status":"verified","doi":"10.1117/12.872245","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"W2141999940","semantic_scholar_id":"","primary_url":"https://doi.org/10.1117/12.872245","citation_count":23,"provenance":[{"source":"openalex","source_id":"W2141999940","url":"https://openalex.org/W2141999940","query":"image steganalysis detection","retrieved_at":"2026-07-15T06:11:49Z"},{"source":"crossref","source_id":"10.1117/12.872245","url":"https://doi.org/10.1117/12.872245","query":"image steganalysis @ IEEE Symposium on Security and Privacy","retrieved_at":"2026-07-16T07:43:12Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：已有稳定来源，且现有任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"},{"id":"paper-d4f7478a6a5c5ac0","title":"Semisubsampled Wavelet Transform Based Image Watermarking with Strong Robustness to Rotation Attacks","title_zh":"","year":2010,"publication_date":"","abstract":"","authors":[{"id":"author-8092eb62695705","name":"Yingkun Hou","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]},{"id":"author-1dcf3e5c617913","name":"Chunxia Zhao","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]},{"id":"author-0319dd1fdc8058","name":"Mingxia Liu","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]},{"id":"author-6160372ea79f9b","name":"Zhengli Zhu","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]},{"id":"author-1ad112f0d59b3b","name":"Deyun Yang","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]}],"institution_ids":[],"venue":{"id":"venue-31ac0fe9fde401","name":"Journal of Multimedia","short_name":"","type":"journal","issn":"1796-2048","rankings":[]},"task_tags":["digital_watermarking"],"contribution_type":"method","review_status":"verified","doi":"10.4304/jmm.5.4.385-392","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"","semantic_scholar_id":"","primary_url":"https://doi.org/10.4304/jmm.5.4.385-392","citation_count":2,"provenance":[{"source":"crossref","source_id":"10.4304/jmm.5.4.385-392","url":"https://doi.org/10.4304/jmm.5.4.385-392","query":"image watermarking @ ACM Multimedia","retrieved_at":"2026-07-16T07:42:52Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：具有稳定来源，且任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"},{"id":"paper-4e7dc0a8aa0f9fc0","title":"A Methodology of Steganalysis for Images","title_zh":"","year":2009,"publication_date":"2009-02-01","abstract":"This paper provides a comparison of some of the steganalysis methods proposed in the literature, and using these comparison results, a global steganalysis methodology is proposed. The secret message detection capacities of these steganalysis methods are evaluated using stegoimages generated by typical data hiding algorithms. The evaluation of steganalysis methods is realized in terms of false negative and false positive error rates using 100 images. There isnpsilat any steganalysis that can detect presence of secret message in all type of stegoimages. Therefore, to realize a reliable analysis about a suspicious image, several steganalysis methods must be efficiently combined. In this paper, some considerations about steganalysis are provided using the results obtained of the comparison of steganalysis methods.","authors":[{"id":"a5058124705","name":"A. Hernandez-Chamorro","orcid":"","institution_ids":["i59361560"]},{"id":"a5001506066","name":"Angelina Espejel-Trujillo","orcid":"","institution_ids":["i59361560"]},{"id":"a5056440496","name":"Juan López‐Hernández","orcid":"0000-0002-9252-6338","institution_ids":["i59361560"]},{"id":"a5077444714","name":"Mariko Nakano-Miyatake","orcid":"0000-0003-1346-7825","institution_ids":["i59361560"]},{"id":"a5068877119","name":"Hector Perez‐Meana","orcid":"0000-0002-7786-2050","institution_ids":["i59361560"]}],"institution_ids":["i59361560"],"venue":null,"task_tags":["image_steganalysis"],"contribution_type":"analysis","review_status":"verified","doi":"10.1109/conielecomp.2009.42","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"W2132040196","semantic_scholar_id":"","primary_url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/conielecomp.2009.42","citation_count":11,"provenance":[{"source":"openalex","source_id":"W2132040196","url":"https://openalex.org/W2132040196","query":"image steganalysis detection","retrieved_at":"2026-07-15T06:11:49Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：已有稳定来源，且现有任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"},{"id":"paper-a4d9c259977f1cc0","title":"Semi-fragile Digital Watermarking Algorithm for Image Tamper Detection and Recovery Resisting Against JPEG Compression","title_zh":"","year":2009,"publication_date":"","abstract":"","authors":[{"id":"49107527","name":"Li Li-juan","orcid":"","institution_ids":[]}],"institution_ids":[],"venue":null,"task_tags":["digital_watermarking","image_forgery"],"contribution_type":"method","review_status":"verified","doi":"","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"","semantic_scholar_id":"1e216414583298dbd985974bc7984f9ee6dae864","primary_url":"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/1e216414583298dbd985974bc7984f9ee6dae864","citation_count":0,"provenance":[{"source":"semantic_scholar","source_id":"1e216414583298dbd985974bc7984f9ee6dae864","url":"https://www.semanticscholar